{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1528488-what-kind-of-magic-would-each-sephira-of-the-tree-of-life-be-associated-with","id":1528488,"title":"what kind of magic would each sephira of the tree of life be associated with.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-01-13T10:16:44-08:00","id":1528488,"title":"what kind of magic would each sephira of the tree of life be associated with.","content":"i'm not talking about the 9 spheres, but just general magic. im having trouble with figuring out what type of magic each sephira would be associated with. i have chesed with healing, geburah with fire, and malkuth with alchemy. any suggestions or anything i could read up on?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27683-bernese","name":"Bernese","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-13T11:42:19-08:00","id":1528490,"title":"","content":"Are you using a specific school of mysticism here? Different groups have had different interpretations of them over time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-13T15:27:28-08:00","id":1528501,"title":"","content":"Intuitively for the Mage context, I would map each sephira to a Sphere (Malkuth being the mundane / no Sphere) and have the paths between them correspond to a magic schools instead. That way you get connections between Spheres and can use their effect combinations to approximate the different schools. Also, having them take the role of paths rather than goals feels more in spirit of the Tree of Life symbolism, imo.<br /> <br /> If you connect them via their Shade Realms and fill in the blanks (opinions may vary) you get:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\">No.</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Sephira</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Sphere</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Shade Realm</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Sephiroth Planet</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Kether</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Entropy</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Pluto</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Origin of all</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"></tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text